  "description": "Token-aware task prioritization and budget management for Claude sessions. Part of the SOSA governance suite. The Orchestrator is the resource-aware brain that sits above individual tasks and decides what runs, what waits, and what stops — based on real-time token budget tracking and business priority scoring.",
